{* The connection you are in, atop the sidebar (Connections::badge()). The colour is
	whitelisted (Color::hex()), hence noescape — see connections.latte. It leads home, to the
	saved connections, like the logo (AdminerDesktop::home()). That address is ours, built from
	adminer's ME, so nocheck: it is relative and carries the server's port, and Latte's URL check
	reads "name.php?pgsql=host:5432" as a scheme and printed an empty href, a link to this page. *}
{parameters \Desktop\Connections\Connection $connection, string $home, string $title}
<a id="ad-connection-badge" href="{$home|nocheck}" title="{$title}" n:attr="style: $connection->color() ? '--ad-conn: ' . $connection->color()">
	<span class="ad-card-icon">{$connection->icon()->html()|noescape}</span>
	<span class="ad-badge-name">{$connection->title()}</span>
	<span n:if="$connection->environment" class="ad-env ad-env-{$connection->environment->value}">{$connection->environment->label()}</span>
</a>
